# Learning Protocol

## After adding a feature
1. Complete the feature (passes `make test`).
2. Append a concise note to `.cursor/skills/add-feature-backend/learned/<feature>.md`.
3. Update `.cursor/skills/add-feature-backend/learned/README.md` index.

## When making an architecture correction
1. Run `.cursor/skills/learn/SKILL.md` to stage a patch under `.cursor/skills/.pending/`.
2. Review staged patches with `.cursor/skills/apply-pending/SKILL.md`.
3. Apply approved patches to the live skill/rule files.

## Rules
- Never rewrite the canonical `SKILL.md` files with feature-specific details.
- Keep `learned/` files short (≤ 30 lines each).
- One learned file per feature, named `<feature>.md`.
